{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb from zero to the top of success! Work, study, start businesses, and build your life in a unique clicker game about the real world.<br><br>Success: Real Life Clicker is a desktop clicker game where every click brings you closer to a new goal in life. Start at the bottom and gradually develop: get your first job, start businesses, invest in stocks and education to achieve real success. The game combines simple clicker mechanics with elements of a real-life simulator, allowing you to feel how small steps lead to big results.<br><br>\ud83d\udd11 Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe2 Work \u2014 earn money by combining different positions at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbc Business \u2014 invest start-up capital, improve businesses and make a profit (or risk losing part of your investment).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda Education \u2014 take courses, develop skills and discover new opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 Stocks and investments \u2014 try your hand at trading, buy and sell stocks, and keep track of your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe6 Bank \u2014 take out loans or make deposits, manage your finances like a real economist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Energy and resources \u2014 balance your time between studying, working and relaxing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 The path to success \u2014 from a simple employee to a respected businessman and investor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is this game for?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of clickers and incremental games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who want to relax, but still feel a sense of development and progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who are interested in the mechanics of \u2018economics\u2019 and \u2018life\u2019 in a gaming format.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012140?t=1759172040","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012140/91713cbd5ac7b8be9afe7e5c8384eb1a458e6ac8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759172040","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012140/d639f76234b78438158cab05f7668c5100419a5e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759172040","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012140/d639f76234b78438158cab05f7668c5100419a5e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759172040","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb from zero to the top of success! Work, study, start businesses, and build your life in a unique clicker game about the real world.<br><br>Success: Real Life Clicker is a desktop clicker game where every click brings you closer to a new goal in life. Start at the bottom and gradually develop: get your first job, start businesses, invest in stocks and education to achieve real success. The game combines simple clicker mechanics with elements of a real-life simulator, allowing you to feel how small steps lead to big results.<br><br>\ud83d\udd11 Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe2 Work \u2014 earn money by combining different positions at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbc Business \u2014 invest start-up capital, improve businesses and make a profit (or risk losing part of your investment).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda Education \u2014 take courses, develop skills and discover new opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 Stocks and investments \u2014 try your hand at trading, buy and sell stocks, and keep track of your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe6 Bank \u2014 take out loans or make deposits, manage your finances like a real economist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Energy and resources \u2014 balance your time between studying, working and relaxing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 The path to success \u2014 from a simple employee to a respected businessman and investor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is this game for?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of clickers and incremental games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who want to relax, but still feel a sense of development and progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who are interested in the mechanics of \u2018economics\u2019 and \u2018life\u2019 in a gaming format.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Artem Morarash"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012140/d2b45053af12d707a2350296f037ac5e86137839/header.jpg?t=1759172040","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4012140/1749338021/4767c243f8fbcaa8ff6f48aa529eb81f27f6f74e/1757253392/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759171077","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4012140/1749338021/4767c243f8fbcaa8ff6f48aa529eb81f27f6f74e